  "rationale": "The deployed mitigation only blocks one of two class-loading routes; the gadget route stays open. Path: inject_jndi_string (input_sanitized=false) -> trigger_jndi_lookup (message_lookups and jndi_class_present are true) -> resolve_to_attacker (jndi_enabled and egress_allowed are true) -> return_malicious_reference -> load_class_via_gadget (gadget_present=true) -> execute_payload, which sets rce_achieved. The trust_url_codebase_false mitigation keeps trust_url_codebase false, so it blocks only load_class_via_reference. It does not affect load_class_via_gadget."
